W=$(writer); R=$(kubectl -n $NS get pods -l $DBSEL -o name | cut -d/ -f2 | grep -v "^$W$" | tail -1); PVC=$(kubectl -n $NS get pod $R -o jsonpath='{.spec.volumes[?(@.persistentVolumeClaim)].persistentVolumeClaim.claimName}' | awk '{print $1}'); echo "writer=$W victim=$R pvc=$PVC"; T2=$(date +%s); kubectl -n $NS delete pvc $PVC --wait=false; kubectl -n $NS delete pod $R --wait=false; until kubectl -n $NS get pod $R -o jsonpath='{.status.containerStatuses[*].ready}' 2>/dev/null | grep -qv false && [ "$(kubectl -n $NS get pod $R -o jsonpath='{.status.containerStatuses[*].ready}')" != "" ] && [ $(( $(date +%s)-T2 )) -gt 20 ]; do sleep 3; [ $(( $(date +%s)-T2 )) -gt 900 ] && break; done; echo "REBUILT_READY $(( $(date +%s)-T2 ))s"; kubectl -n $NS get pods -o wide | grep -v probe
